              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuputule wa pa mwinshi, ne nsolokoto shauko, no tuncindu utwalengelwe pa fibumba, fyalifye cimo cine na filya fyali ku mpongolo ya ku kabanga. Kwaliko na matabo cine lubali ayakunininapo pakuya ku mpongolo, no muputule wa pa mwinshi wabelele kumpela ukulungatana no lubansa lwa mwilinga lyakunse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
