        },
        {
          "text": "Ne miputule ya bamalonda, ne fibumba fyamukati no muputule wa pa mwinshi, fyonse fyalingenefye ubukulu na filya fyali ku mpongolo shimbi. Impongolo pamo no muputule waiko uwa pa mwinshi fyali ne nsolokoto mu fibumba fyonse. Ubutali bwafiko bwali amakubiti amakumi yasano (50), mubufumo mwena yali amakubiti amakumi yabili na yasano (25). ",
