        },
        {
          "text": "Ne miputule iya bamalonda, no muputule wa pa mwinshi ne fibumba fine ifyamukati, fyonse fyalingenefye ubukulu na filya fine fyali ku mpongolo shimbi. Impongolo no muputule waiko uwa pa mwinshi fyali ne nsolokoto mu fibumba fyonse. Ne nshila yali amakubiti amakumi yasano (50) mubutali, mubufumo mwena yali amakubiti yabili na yasano (25). ",
