        {
          "text": "Nako kwine kwali imiputule iya bamalonda, ne fibumba fyamukati ifyalengelwepo utuncindu, no muputule wa pa mwinshi, ne nsolokoto mu fibumba fyonse. Ne nshila iyalipo yali amakubiti amakumi yasano (50) mubutali, mubufumo mwena yali amakubiti amakumi yabili na yasano (25). ",
