              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lubansa lwa mwilinga lyakunse, mwalimo umuputule umo, pakuyamo kano ukupitila mu muputule wa pa mwinshi uwalungatene no lubansa lwa mwilinga lyamukati. Emo balesambila ifitumbi fya nama isho baleoca pakushituula ilambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
