          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu muputule wa pa mwinshi mwali amatebulo yane, uku yabili, noku yabili. Pali ayo yene amatebulo epo baleipaila inama ishakutuula ilambo ilyakoca, nangu umutuulo wakwelelwa pa fyabubifi nangu umutuulo wakufuta pa bubifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa ku cibumba ca panse ica muputule wa pa mwinshi napo pali amatebulo yane, uku yabili, noku yabili. Yabelele lwa mu nshila iyakwishila ku mpongolo ya ku kapinda ka ku kuso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi mukati ka muputule mwali amatebulo yane, panse napo yane, epa matebulo cine konse konse ayo baleipailapo inama isho bali nokutuula ilambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amatebulo yane ayo balepekanishishapo amalambo ayakoca, yapangilwe na mabwe ayasonwa, mubutali ukuya pamulu yalepele kubiti umo, mubufumo na mubutali mwena yali kubiti umo na citika. Ni pali ayo yene amatebulo epo balebika ifibombelo ifyakwipailako inama sha malambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwali ne finkobwe ifyalepele nge cisansa ca lupi, ifyapampamikwe ukushinguluka icibumba. Pali aya yene amatebulo epo balebika inama shonse ishakutuula ilambo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        }
