          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo kabili anyingisha mu muputule uwakwingililamo pakuya mwi Tempele. Awe alapima na pa bwingililo, mubwipi pa mbali shonse shibili palepele amakubiti yasano, kabili mubufumo amakubiti ikumi limo na yane (14), ne fibumba ifyalipo uku noku fyatikeme amakubiti yatatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.48"
            ]
          }
        },
